#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid "A minimal WordPress FSE starter theme. The shared foundation beneath Kern, Masthead, Parcel, and Wake — four niche editorial themes built on it. Use it as-is for a clean, accessible start, or build on the CORE/SKIN architecture to make your own themed version without touching the portable core files."
msgstr ""

